 "id": 592784720090,
 "title": "Gravel Bike by Jeremy",
 "body_html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"680938726\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.680938726 c542\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What made you decide to build a bamboo bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">It was a birthday\u2019s gift, but I was looking on bamboo bikes since a while. Almost everyone around me was aware that I wanted to make one.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"845063547\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\"><span class=\"M7eMe\"></span></h4>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">Did you enjoy building the bicycle from scratch and would you recommend the experience?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">The building was really interesting, I learned how to work with bamboo (thanks to James videos).</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"805044919\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c547\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What did you find most difficult about your bike build?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Sanding ! Not really difficult, but very time consuming if you want smooth jonctions. At some point I just give up cause I saw that I would never have ride this bike during summer.</div>\n<h4 class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"1370153519\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What was the easiest part of the build?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Painting the lugs.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"862135650\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.862135650 c552\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">How would you describe the ride of your finished bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Very smooth and responsive.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"1476906189\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1476906189 c555\"><span class=\"M7eMe\"></span></h4>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1476906189 c555\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What would you improve about the build experience or your finished bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Have choice to not include the laser cut jigs and propose to download 3D models to print them at home. It will reduce the price of the kit and I found 3D printed jigs more accurate and sturdy.</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_20221022_155234_-_Jeremy_Saudrais_1024x1024.jpg?v=1689601043\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_20230520_095201_-_Jeremy_Saudrais_1024x1024.jpg?v=1689601051\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/IMG_20220926_185440_-_Jeremy_Saudrais_1024x1024.jpg?v=1689601058\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"Fr6DJf\" jsaction=\"JIbuQc:Fh4HNb(mWZCyf);gdexC:dLu6cf;\" data-input=\"L9xHkb\" data-item-id=\"2068819458\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" id=\"c556\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.2068819458\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
